pomo (1.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Session-specific sounds: separate sounds for focus and break end
    (FOCUS_SOUND/BREAK_SOUND in pomo.conf, played via paplay/aplay with
    a bell fallback).
  * "pomo" without arguments now asks for confirmation before starting
    a focus session.

 -- Yapidev <yapidev@users.noreply.github.com>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 07:30:00 +0700

pomo (1.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Config file pomo.conf for durations and the NOTIFY_CMD hook.
  * "pomo status" one-line output for status bars (tmux/waybar), with
    --json for status-bar styling.
  * "pomo resume" continues a session interrupted by a closed terminal
    or a crash.
  * build-deb.sh now derives the package version from POMO_VERSION in
    the script itself, so the .deb label always matches.

 -- Yapidev <yapidev@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:28:40 +0700

pomo (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of pomo, a pomodoro timer TUI in pure Bash.
  * Large block-character countdown, progress bar, automatic focus/break
    cycle, desktop notifications and session statistics.

 -- Yapidev <yapidev@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:00:00 +0700
